# {{title}}

A BHMS device server generated by `bhms new {{name}}`.

```
python -m pytest                  # unit tests, in-process
bhms dev server.py                # interactive inspector: list, describe, read, invoke, watch operations
bhms ls server.py                 # one-shot commands accept the same target
bhms call server.py {{device_id}} move_to target=42.5
bhms mcp server.py                # serve it to Claude, Cursor or any MCP client over stdio
```

Edit `server.py`: replace the simulated `Stage` with your driver, keep `evidence`, `effect`, units and bounds honest.
